    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">On October 12, 2026, the Reporting Person was granted a Make-Whole Award of 461,538 Restricted Stock Units (&quot;RSUs&quot; or &quot;Units&quot;) pursuant to the Mattel, Inc. Amended and Restated 2010 Equity and Long-Term Compensation Plan, as amended (the &quot;Plan&quot;). The RSUs vested immediately upon grant, and each Unit was settled for one share of Mattel, Inc. Common Stock on the grant date.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Pursuant to the terms of the October 12, 2026 Make-Whole Award, 234,831 shares of Mattel, Inc. Common Stock were automatically withheld at vesting to cover required tax withholding.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">On October 12, 2026, the Reporting Person was granted 307,692 Annual RSUs pursuant to the Plan. Each Unit represents a contingent right to receive one share of Mattel, Inc. Common Stock (or, at the election of Mattel, Inc., a cash amount equal to the fair market value of such share).</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">The Annual RSUs vest as to (a) 33% of the Units on May 1, 2027, (b) an additional 33% of the Units on May 1, 2028, and (c) the remaining 34% of the Units on May 1, 2029. On each vesting date, for each Unit vesting on such date, the Reporting Person will receive one share of Mattel, Inc. Common Stock (or, at the election of Mattel, Inc., a cash amount equal to the fair market value of one share of Common Stock on the date of vesting), subject to tax withholding.</footnote>
